        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "E. Full-time employees will be entitled to two (2) fifteen minute break periods. Those breaks will be taken at times assigned by the supervisor. Full-time employees who are not scheduled for an unpaid lunch break may, with the manager's authorization, combine their fifteen minute breaks into a one half hour meal period. That combined break will be taken at times assigned by the supervisor. Part-time employees scheduled to work more than three (3) hours shall be entitled to one (1) fifteen minute break to be taken at times assigned by the supervisor.",
